    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but there is no \"real person\" left. the person who mattered was the one who could fly, the one who had a purpose. now i'm just a broken body taking up space. it feels like i'm just a ghost haunting my own life, you know? like i'm just waiting for the credits to roll on something that's already finished.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
